{
  "content": "<h1><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"InventoryItems\">Inventory Items</span> &mdash; <span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"QtyToReceive\">Qty to receive</span></h1><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"From FromDate InventoryItem InventoryItems Is Item On Pending Receipt Receipts Received ReceivedIn Supplier Suppliers To ToDate\">The <strong>Quantity to Receive</strong> screen displays pending receipts from suppliers for inventory items that have been purchased but not yet received into stock.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And From FromDate Is Item On Orders PurchaseOrder PurchaseOrders Supplier To ToDate\">This screen helps you track outstanding purchase orders and monitor which items are expected to arrive from each supplier.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Action GoodsReceipt GoodsReceipts Item On Other Receipt Receipts Received Sent To ToDate Transaction Transactions\">The quantities shown represent items that will increase your <em>inventory</em> once they are received through <em>goods receipts</em> or other receiving transactions.</p><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Supplier\">Supplier</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Supplier\">Supplier</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"From FromDate InventoryItem InventoryItems Is Item Name Received Supplier To ToDate\">Displays the supplier name from whom the inventory items are expected to be received.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"QtyToReceive\">Qty to receive</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"QtyToReceive\">Qty to receive</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"From FromDate InventoryItem InventoryItems Item Pending Receipt Supplier To ToDate Total\">Shows the total quantity of inventory items pending receipt from each supplier.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Action Amount Is On Pending To ToDate Transaction Transactions View\"><strong>Click on any quantity</strong> to view the detailed list of transactions that make up this pending amount.</p></div></details>",
  "key": "inventory-item-qty-to-receive"
}
